{"id": "EUVD-2026-107675", "enisaUuid": "a152cb97-f49c-301b-aa44-6824f1f14f93", "description": "GitLab has remediated an issue in GitLab EE affecting all versions from 19.2 before 19.3.6, 19.4 before 19.4.3, and 19.5 before 19.5.1 that, when an instance administrator locked a group's Duo availability, an authenticated user with group Owner permissions could have re-enabled AI-backed data egress to a third-party service for that group and its descendant projects, due to insufficient granularity of the admin-lock enforcement controls.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T23:34:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T23:34:45", "baseScore": 2.7, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/work_items/631564", "https://hackerone.com/reports/3871692", "https://docs.gitlab.com/releases/patches/patch-release-gitlab-19-5-1-released/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-103515", "GHSA-x828-vfgm-5mgh"], "assigner": "GitLab", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4231d219-dceb-3f6f-94b3-d653f99abd0a", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "19.5 <19.5.1"}, {"id": "e871cde8-31ee-326e-8b67-215c644b37c1", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "19.2 <19.3.6"}, {"id": "f9ffc4ea-04b4-3cd3-a571-f3521988dd28", "product": {"name": "GitLab", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}, "product_version": "19.4 <19.4.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "bc3fb930-9b49-3e8e-8de6-bd7ef7cee822", "vendor": {"name": "GitLab"}}], "isExploited": false}